From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] quectel_QMI_WWAN: enable QMAPv5 DL checksum offload

Respect QMAPv5 downlink checksum offload status bit so verified
packets set CHECKSUM_UNNECESSARY cleanly on RM520F-GL and peers.

Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 qmi_wwan_q.c | 7 +++----
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/qmi_wwan_q.c b/qmi_wwan_q.c
index 7dbed45..15f3d1f 100644
--- a/qmi_wwan_q.c
+++ b/qmi_wwan_q.c
@@ -2007,11 +2007,10 @@ static void qmap_packet_decode(sQmiWwanQmap *pQmapDev,
 		if(skip_nss)
 			qmap_skb->cb[0] = 1;
 
-		if (ul_header && ul_header->header_type == RMNET_MAP_HEADER_TYPE_CSUM_OFFLOAD
-			&& ul_header->csum_valid_required) {
-#if 0 //TODO
+		if (ul_header &&
+		    ul_header->header_type == RMNET_MAP_HEADER_TYPE_CSUM_OFFLOAD &&
+		    !ul_header->next_hdr && ul_header->csum_valid_required) {
 			qmap_skb->ip_summed = CHECKSUM_UNNECESSARY;
-#endif
 		}
 
 		if (qmap_skb->dev->type == ARPHRD_ETHER) {
